  "body": "**Blocked by:** #174\n\n## Context\n\nThis issue builds on #174; #244 is the next sequential slice of the `operations` batch.\n\n## Task\n\nDefine root:root 0600 `/opt/semprec/shared/.env` plus apns-key.p8. Commit a values-free example for master/setup/VAPID/APNs/provider/OAuth/distinct DB+MinIO/restic/healthchecks values. Distribute through EnvironmentFile and Docker env_file. Keep external_credentials encrypted and separate; copy no secrets into releases/logs/backups.\n\n## Scope\n\n### In scope\n\n- Task deliverables, migrations, integration, tests, and necessary documentation.\n\n### Out of scope\n\n- No OpenBao/vault or rotation automation.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- Exact ownership/mode and idempotent preservation of operator values.\n- Every required key is documented without value.\n- All consumers load shared env and releases contain none.\n- Runtime credentials remain separate/encrypted.\n",
